@startuml
' UI operation descriptions group MainWindow's owned panel and ListView helpers.
' Renderer: PlantUML 1.2025.3, using the committed style.puml unchanged.
' From the repository root:
' java -jar plantuml-1.2025.3.jar -charset UTF-8 -tpng -o ../images docs/diagrams/LessonRetrieval.puml
!include style.puml
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam DefaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontStyle normal
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
hide footbox


participant "window:MainWindow" as UI UI_COLOR
participant "displayed:ObservableList" as Displayed LOGIC_COLOR
participant "retrieval:LessonRetrieval" as Retrieval LOGIC_COLOR
participant "previous:ObservableList" as Previous MODEL_COLOR
participant "selected:ObservableList" as Next MODEL_COLOR

note over UI, Next
  Bind once at UI setup
end note
UI -> Retrieval : getDisplayedLessons()\n(via Logic and session)
Retrieval --> UI : same read-only observable list
UI -> UI : Bind list and heading once\nvia LessonListPanel
note over Displayed, Retrieval
  LessonRetrieval owns the backing list and exposes
  one stable read-only wrapper to the UI.
end note

note over UI, Next
  Choose a result source
end note
UI -> Retrieval : Request lessons, search or lesson details\n(via Logic and commands)
Retrieval -> Retrieval : Resolve request; set heading context
note over Retrieval, Next
  Source: catalogue, student's lessons, search results,
  or LessonRetrieval's own lesson-detail list.
  Student index is resolved once to a stable ID.
end note

opt Selected source changes
    Retrieval -> Previous : removeListener(refresh)
    Retrieval -> Retrieval : selected = new source
    Retrieval -> Next : addListener(refresh)
end

Retrieval -> Displayed : Refresh backing contents\nfrom selected source
Displayed -> UI : Notify registered list-change listener

note over UI, Next
  Later changes
end note
Next -> Retrieval : Selected source changes\n(refresh listener)
Retrieval -> Displayed : Refresh backing contents
Displayed -> UI : Notify registered list-change listener

note over UI, Next
  People-list changes do not retarget the lesson selection or heading.
  Context retains the selected stable IDs or filters independently.
end note
@enduml
